# Associations

## Framework semantics

Support `belongsTo`, `hasOne`, `hasMany`, `belongsToMany` with foreign/binding keys, strategies, and save options.

## Required behavior

- Configure associations on Tables with correct keys.
- Choose loading strategy consciously (`join` vs `select`).
- Understand cascading/dependent delete implications before enabling them.

## Anti-patterns

- Over-eager contain
- Incorrect foreign key assumptions

## Review checklist

- [ ] Keys and class names correct
- [ ] Loading strategy matches use case